		3.9.0 - Merged TD-2 YP production with TD-3.1 Gemini pre-production.
		3.9.1 - Added many items to data logging for soft soil work.
		3.9.2 - Quick maintenance update, immediately before starting soft soil code.
		3.9.3 - Added water setting for situations where hammer is on.
		3.9.4 - Removed LC_CLEAR state transition from screw drive.
		3.9.5 - Fixed premature air off when drill retract completes after screw drive finishes.
		3.9.6 - Faster drill extend, faster rampdown, and using UC track pos for drill retract in screw drive.
		3.9.7 - Added diagnostic screen for wired outputs
