		4.2.4 - Adding the ability to set the LR encoder resolution from the HMI.
		4.2.5 - Small HMI changes.
		4.2.6 - Upper crowd speed on reveal is now 50 cm/sec.
		4.2.7 - Gemini field updates to soft soil, particularly for the lower LC pressure..
