		4.3.3 - Modified slightly the retry logic in SS when screw stalls post "retract before end of drive" starts.
		4.3.4 - Starting to integrate wing bit operation with wingless bit operation.  One algorithm to rule them all...
		4.3.5 - Adding D gain for better LR control, fixed a couple soft soil recovery bugs
		4.3.6 - Wingless bits can hammer inside of screw, reduced SS stall retries, increase ASSIST UC range, LC/UR compensator warnings
